The plugin supports learning optimal curvature per hierarchy:

```
Flat hierarchy (organization chart)  --> Low curvature (-0.1)
Deep hierarchy (taxonomy)            --> High curvature (-2.0)
Mixed hierarchy                      --> Adaptive curvature via SONA
